Dialogue: 10,0:00:03.94,0:00:04.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.67,0:00:09.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Master, ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.68,0:00:11.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada Irregular yang muncul!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.49,0:00:12.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Irregular?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.99,0:00:16.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebutan untuk monster\Nyang seharusnya tidak ada di lantai ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.34,0:00:21.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terkadang, monster berlevel tinggi\Nmasuk ke lantai-lantai awal.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.50,0:00:25.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di ruangan depan sana,\Nada petualang yang diserang Irregular!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:25.09,0:00:27.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa Tuan mau menolongnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.19,0:00:31.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, sepertinya aku memang\Nterlalu baik hati.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.87,0:00:33.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa tidak?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:33.68,0:00:37.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga merasakan aroma keuntungan\Ndari daya sihir ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.94,0:00:39.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aduh!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.85,0:00:41.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hati-hati, dong!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.63,0:00:42.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.61,0:00:44.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan waktunya cari masalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.28,0:00:49.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau masih sayang nyawa,\Nsebaiknya jangan pergi ke sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.74,0:00:52.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kalian yakin?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.62,0:00:54.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Daripada kita semua mati?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.91,0:00:58.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wanita itu juga pasti puas\Nkarena akhirnya bisa berguna.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.09,0:01:03.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah mereka petualang yang diserang itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.88,0:01:07.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, petualang yang aku deteksi tadi\Nada empat orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.39,0:01:08.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih ada satu orang.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.02,0:01:10.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa dia telat kabur?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.62,0:01:12.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entahlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.05,0:01:14.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Ayo, Empee!\N- Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.19,0:01:24.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lo? Jalan buntu?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.08,0:01:26.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, coba perhatikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.79,0:01:30.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma tembok ini yang bentuknya\Nberbeda sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.47,0:01:32.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mungkin dibuat dengan sihir.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.96,0:01:34.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terasa hangat.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.28,0:01:36.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti baru saja dibuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Empee, menjauhlah sedikit.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:44.73,0:01:45.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fireball!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.67,0:01:53.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.14,0:01:56.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Quad Skeleton!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:56.76,0:01:59.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Master, ada orang!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:01.63,0:02:03.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih bisa bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.80,0:02:06.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Majulah!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.56,0:04:12.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gara-gara kau, waktu itu kita terpaksa\Nbatal menaklukkan lantai tiga.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.96,0:04:15.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awas saja kalau kau ceroboh lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.73,0:04:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik, maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.61,0:04:22.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gara-gara kau selalu jadi beban,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:22.49,0:04:25.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,rank petualang kami macet di D terus.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.19,0:04:26.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.17,0:04:30.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pikirkan juga kami yang harus\Nmembawa attacker tidak berguna.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.00,0:04:32.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.04,0:04:33.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari tadi minta maaf melulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.63,0:04:35.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengar, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.67,0:04:37.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siapa pun juga bisa minta maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.99,0:04:40.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Buktikan dengan tindakanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.89,0:04:47.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ma-Makhluk apa dia?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.96,0:04:50.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bos lantai tiga?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.52,0:04:53.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak, bukan.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.77,0:04:56.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia Irregular!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.55,0:05:02.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.65,0:05:05.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini aku takkan mengecewakan kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.29,0:05:08.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.54,0:05:12.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, untuk terakhir kalinya,\Nsetidaknya bergunalah untuk kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.64,0:05:19.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya Rinka bisa berguna juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.01,0:05:23.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sip, ayo kita kabur dari sini.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.09,0:05:32.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa mereka mengurungku di sini\Nuntuk menjadikanku umpan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.69,0:05:33.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dibuang?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.72,0:05:35.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.86,0:05:38.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku hanya diberi tugas untuk mengulur waktu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.78,0:05:41.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Agar mereka bertiga bisa melarikan diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.92,0:05:45.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka, kau itu cuma beban, tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.03,0:05:47.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bukan karena kau,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.36,0:05:49.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami pasti sudah jauh lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.01,0:06:03.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku masih bisa bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.57,0:06:06.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Majulah!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.07,0:06:35.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tulang Besar.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.95,0:06:38.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana rasanya bola api tadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.59,0:06:39.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar aku sembuhkan dulu\Ndengan sihir pemulihan.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.43,0:06:46.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Awas! Dia masih bergerak!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.52,0:07:03.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sepertinya dia tidak bisa\Nlangsung dikalahkan, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.27,0:07:06.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, pakai serangan pemungkas!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.35,0:07:11.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fireball!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.75,0:07:17.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu core-nya!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.29,0:07:19.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Quick Stab...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.17,0:07:27.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Master baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.84,0:07:29.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Untung saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.35,0:07:45.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah tahu kelemahannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akan kuakhiri dengan satu serangan ini!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.21,0:07:52.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Manajemen Sihir:
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.05,0:08:05.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima ini, Fireball 20 kali lipat!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:31.69,0:08:33.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, kau sudah tahu?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.33,0:08:35.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya, kelompok Gugus Meteor\Nbakal datang ke Melba.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:36.12,0:08:37.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Party rank A itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:38.08,0:08:40.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku ingin coba menemui mereka.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:42.67,0:08:43.38,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.54,0:08:44.84,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.56,0:08:51.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau aku, tolong tanda tangani bajuku.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.17,0:08:52.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.41,0:08:56.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, akan kujadikan jimat petualangan.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku jadi ikut senang.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.94,0:09:01.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Roger.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.24,0:09:06.00,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak dimakan, bagianmu akan kumakan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.00,0:09:08.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu dulu, sebentar lagi juga selesai.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.65,0:09:11.80,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Roger ini masih saja jadi rebutan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.92,0:09:22.76,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Tujuan kami, Gugus Meteor,\Nadalah menaklukkan seluruh Dungeon Agung!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.76,0:09:26.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo taruhan, menurut kalian\Nkami bakal berhasil atau gagal?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.45,0:09:28.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tentu saja kami bertaruh kalian berhasil!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.53,0:09:29.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.45,0:09:30.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga sama!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.55,0:09:34.60,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Kalau begini, bukan taruhan namanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.05,0:09:37.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gawat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.15,0:09:46.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di Dungeon Agung muncul Irregular!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.05,0:09:51.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bengkarak besar bertangan empat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.93,0:09:55.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di Dungeon Agung muncul Irregular!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.75,0:09:59.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bengkarak besar bertangan empat!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:00.29,0:10:02.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bilang Irregular?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.52,0:10:04.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bengkarak bertangan empat?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.81,0:10:06.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Quad Skeleton, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:08.19,0:10:09.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.21,0:10:13.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong jelaskan secara rinci\Nlokasi kalian bertemu Irregular.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.71,0:10:15.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kami kirim pasukan pembasmi.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.55,0:10:18.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami tidak baik-baik saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.13,0:10:21.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Salah satu rekan kami...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.72,0:10:23.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.79,0:10:28.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mengorbankan dirinya menjadi umpan\Nagar kami bisa kabur!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.82,0:10:29.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sial!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:32.07,0:10:33.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Umpan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.47,0:10:36.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya, Rinka...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.57,0:10:38.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, dia mungkin sudah...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.20,0:10:42.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Periksa apakah dia masih hidup!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.27,0:10:43.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.96,0:10:45.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namanya Rinka, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.11,0:10:49.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.71,0:10:55.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia benar-benar orang yang baik.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.69,0:11:01.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kabar baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.68,0:11:03.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka masih hidup!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.85,0:11:12.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, kita harus menyelamatkannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.52,0:11:13.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.36,0:11:14.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.55,0:11:16.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harusnya dia sudah dikurung, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.73,0:11:20.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.92,0:11:30.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami akan menyelamatkan Rinka\Nsekaligus membasmi Irregular itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.13,0:11:34.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Party Gugus Meteor, kalian serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.41,0:11:36.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya sudah lama tidak ke Dungeon Agung.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.07,0:11:39.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biar kami bereskan untuk pemanasan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.89,0:11:40.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalian dengar itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.85,0:11:42.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Party Gugus Meteor yang mau membasminya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.41,0:11:44.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh! Sangat bisa diandalkan!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.85,0:11:47.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak perlu.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:53.08,0:11:55.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami sudah mengalahkannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.24,0:11:57.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.72,0:12:03.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, bukankah kau Lent?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.64,0:12:06.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Roger? Lama tidak ketemu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.47,0:12:09.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, wanita yang di sebelahmu itu...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:10.03,0:12:10.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.35,0:12:13.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku telah ditolong oleh Lent.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.80,0:12:14.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gila!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:14.76,0:12:17.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah siapa dia, tapi jago juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.19,0:12:20.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan! Dia bocah yang berpapasan\Ndengan kita waktu itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.17,0:12:22.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, wah, apa maksud perkataanmu itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.01,0:12:25.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setidaknya berterimakasihlah pada anak itu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.18,0:12:28.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau bagaimana lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena merekalah\Nyang menjadikan Rinka tumbal.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.09,0:12:34.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tumbal?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.48,0:12:39.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bu-Bukan!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.75,0:12:41.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia cuma membual!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.56,0:12:46.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa ini?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.59,0:12:48.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pecahan tembok yang dibuat dengan daya sihir.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.77,0:12:52.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka membuat tembok dengan sihir
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.95,0:12:54.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan memutus jalan keluar Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.48,0:12:57.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jika dianalisis,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.26,0:13:00.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,seharusnya kita akan tahu\Nkapan dibuat dan siapa pembuatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.34,0:13:01.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keterlaluan banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:05.89,0:13:07.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.59,0:13:09.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak benar, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:09.37,0:13:11.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan diam saja, katakanlah sesuatu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.37,0:13:14.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kami, para petualang, hidup untuk hari ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.21,0:13:17.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tak ada jaminan besok masih hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.11,0:13:21.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itulah, kami menaruh\Nkepercayaan mutlak pada rekan
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.09,0:13:23.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,yang saling menjaga di medan pertempuran.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.44,0:13:25.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka yang telah mengkhianati rekannya...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.85,0:13:33.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,tidak pantas untuk hidup.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.43,0:13:46.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tahu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kalian punya pembelaan?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.53,0:14:00.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mending kita berburu\Nbuat menyegarkan pikiran.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.86,0:14:01.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.05,0:14:02.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, Lent.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.97,0:14:03.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,I-Iya?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.19,0:14:06.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kosongkan waktumu lusa malam.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.76,0:14:07.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:08.60,0:14:09.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai jumpa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:13.19,0:14:15.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lent, sampai ketemu lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.79,0:14:21.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Membasmi dan menyelamatkan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.25,0:14:24.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau benar-benar luar biasa, Nak.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.75,0:14:29.27,dialog,,0,0,0,,Minggir.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.71,0:14:31.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Comet mau lewat.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.33,0:14:36.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.65,0:14:38.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.60,0:14:42.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mereka orang-orang yang penuh energi, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.81,0:14:45.86,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Lo? Itu kan cumi bakar milikku.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.09,0:14:45.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah party Gugus Meteor.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.86,0:14:46.70,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Takkan kuberikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.33,0:14:50.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Omong-omong, Lent, Rinka,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:51.33,0:14:53.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,bisa minta waktunya sebentar?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekian pemeriksaannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.89,0:15:08.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih atas kerja samanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.01,0:15:13.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kristalnya bersinar biru\Nsepanjang pemeriksaan,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.68,0:15:16.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,jadi kesaksian Lent terbukti benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.24,0:15:19.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana dengan tiga orang itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.52,0:15:23.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tadi, pemeriksaan mereka\Nsudah dilakukan di tempat terpisah.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:24.86,0:15:28.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rinka sendiri yang bilang mau jadi umpan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.21,0:15:34.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sialan!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.52,0:15:36.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memaksa rekannya menjadi umpan.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.32,0:15:41.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu memberikan laporan palsu kepada guild.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.65,0:15:43.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Keduanya merupakan kejahatan berat.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.31,0:15:46.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Status petualang mereka dicabut permanen.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:47.07,0:15:51.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebagai kriminal, mereka mungkin dipaksa\Nbekerja di tambang dalam waktu lama.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.59,0:15:55.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.77,0:16:03.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lent,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.01,0:16:06.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,sekali lagi, terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:07.04,0:16:08.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah ini, apa rencanamu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.92,0:16:11.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Belum ada rencana khusus.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.16,0:16:14.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Party-ku juga sudah bubar.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.16,0:16:16.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lihat ini.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:16.73,0:16:19.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku dapat uang sebanyak ini\Nberkat membasmi Quad Skeleton.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:20.27,0:16:21.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semua ini berkatmu, Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itu,\Nsetidaknya biarkan aku mentraktirmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.16,0:16:25.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ta-Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.67,0:16:28.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak bisa terus-terusan merepotkanmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:28.44,0:16:32.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya, aku juga baru dibuang\Noleh rekan-rekanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.14,0:16:34.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau juga?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.01,0:16:37.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dengarkanlah sebentar ceritaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.05,0:16:38.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti akan kudengarkan ceritamu juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.23,0:16:49.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini sudah ketujuh kalinya aku dibuang.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:49.20,0:16:50.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tujuh kali?!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.66,0:16:52.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah sebanyak itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.75,0:16:53.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terus terang,
Dialogue: 10,0:16:53.88,0:16:56.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,kejadian kali ini benar-benar\Nmembuatku terpukul.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.71,0:17:07.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gift-ku tidak membiarkanku\Nmeninggalkan medan pertempuran.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.39,0:17:08.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,SSS?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.01,0:17:10.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jalan Bertarung Asura?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:10.59,0:17:12.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukankah ini Gift Unik?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.34,0:17:14.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu hanya nama belaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.93,0:17:16.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aslinya sangat parah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.67,0:17:18.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal kemampuanku tidak memadai.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.45,0:17:21.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gift-ku mendorongku untuk terus bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:22.77,0:17:24.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sampai aku mati.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.97,0:17:26.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah takdirku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:29.77,0:17:32.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku juga banyak mengalami\Nkesulitan karena Gift-ku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.83,0:17:35.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dibuang rekan-rekanku yang sudah lama bersama
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.31,0:17:38.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,karena alasan aku tidak berguna.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.72,0:17:41.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sampai menyesali kelemahanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.44,0:17:42.37,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Selamat tinggal.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.65,0:17:45.24,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Bayarnya nanti kalau sudah sukses.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.92,0:17:51.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, Gift-ku jugalah yang menyelamatkanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.40,0:17:55.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gift-ku adalah Penyimpanan Sihir Tanpa Batas.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gift Unik sama sepertimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.72,0:17:59.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sungguh?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:01.43,0:18:02.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Babi?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.36,0:18:07.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah suatu hari nanti\Naku juga bisa diselamatkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.80,0:18:10.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau membentuk party denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Denganku?\N- Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.19,0:18:14.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Fungsi Gift-ku adalah\Nuntuk mendukung rekanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:14.83,0:18:16.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku yakin pasti bisa membantumu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.24,0:18:22.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini sama sekali tidak berguna.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:22.88,0:18:24.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhenti saja jadi petualang.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:24.54,0:18:27.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada-ada saja disebut Gift Unik.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.55,0:18:29.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bukan karena kau,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.04,0:18:31.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami pasti sudah jauh lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.15,0:18:36.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.76,0:18:39.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bersamaku, aku hanya akan menghambatmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:40.76,0:18:43.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai sekarang,\Naku akan bertualang sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:47.48,0:18:49.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Halo, Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.91,0:18:52.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku adalah Peri Gift\Nyang membantu Tuan Master,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.31,0:18:55.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,namaku Empee.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.24,0:18:56.53,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Maaf, maaf.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.53,0:18:58.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Peri Gift?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.72,0:18:59.52,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.52,0:19:01.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf sudah membuatmu terkejut.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.01,0:19:06.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Biasanya, Peri Gift hanya bisa dilihat\Noleh pemilik Gift itu sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.59,0:19:08.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Namun, berkat perkembangan Tuan Master,
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.76,0:19:12.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku jadi bisa terlihat oleh orang\Nyang Tuan Master kehendaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.69,0:19:15.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan khawatir.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.34,0:19:18.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Master tidak akan menganggapmu beban.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.77,0:19:20.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena kau adalah...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.47,0:19:23.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Investasi yang sangat menjanjikan.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.65,0:19:25.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Investasi?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.29,0:19:26.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa maksudnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:26.94,0:19:29.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei! Dia malah jadi curiga!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.93,0:19:31.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aneh sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.73,0:19:33.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku bermaksud memujinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.52,0:19:38.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau bersamaku, kau akan jadi lebih kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.36,0:19:41.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, kalau kau menjadi kuat,\Naku juga ikut menjadi kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:42.19,0:19:43.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itulah skill milikku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.09,0:19:49.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah orang sepertiku\Nbenar-benar bisa menjadi kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.21,0:19:51.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya, tentu saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:52.43,0:19:53.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:54.00,0:19:56.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau pasti tidak percaya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.56,0:19:59.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana kalau sebentar saja
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.89,0:20:01.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,kau mencobanya dulu?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.16,0:20:17.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu adalah kata-kata Lent yang pernah\Nmenyelamatkan nyawaku.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.92,0:20:21.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan coba memercayaimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:26.21,0:20:27.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Bagus!\N- Mantap!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:37.17,0:20:39.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lent dan Rinka.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.23,0:20:42.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apakah anggotanya cukup dua orang?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.92,0:20:43.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:43.96,0:20:46.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,\Ntolong beri tahu nama party kalian.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.75,0:20:51.88,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dibandingkan petualang lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.88,0:20:54.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami adalah orang-orang anomali.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.39,0:20:55.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anomali?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:55.82,0:20:56.40,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, karena kita punya Gift Unik.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.28,0:20:59.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemudian,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.28,0:21:04.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,kita menderita karena Gift Unik\Nyang seharusnya memberikan keuntungan.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:06.25,0:21:09.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu, dengan menggabungkan kekuatan,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:09.92,0:21:11.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku ingin percaya kita bisa bersinar.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.51,0:21:14.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Karena itulah, nama party kita adalah
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.81,0:21:17.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Twice Exceptional.
